<newsitem itemid="107716" id="root" date="1996-10-10" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Autopage raises half-yr shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Autopage raises half-yr shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Aug 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     3.5	   vs   1.5</p>
<p>    Headline shr (cts)    3.6	   vs   1.2</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs    -</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.28	  vs   0.54</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.12	  vs   1.21</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.36	  vs   0.66</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.91	  vs   0.28 paid</p>
<p>    Turnover		133.75	  vs  95.52</p>
<p>Full name: Autopage Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it was optimistic about the future of South Africa's personal communications market.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
